0:["uZlw_rSN16EBLe2H5Gx5t",[[["",{"children":[["slug","top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Voice-over Narration in Movies\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly\"}]}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Voice-over Narration in Movies"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Voiceover is used in most TV and online advertisements, as well as in cartoons and explainer videos.\r\nBut voiceover narration is also used in countless films to help tell the story. When used badly,\r\nvoiceover narration feels hackneyed or unnecessary; when used well, voiceover narration talks\r\ndirectly to the viewer, creating an immersive cinematic experience. In this article, we’re going to\r\ndiscuss our top 5 films that use voice-over narration perfectly. Give it a read to see if your favourite\r\nvoiceover performance makes the list!</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>5) Goodfellas</h2>\r\n<p>Goodfellas makes good use of voiceover narration throughout, but its intro is the most memorable\r\npart and perhaps one of the most memorable film intros of all time. It starts with ‘As far back as I can\r\nremember, I always wanted to be a gangster…’ and it goes on to describe how the main character\r\n(played by Ray Liotta) began his life of crime. This intro works well because it sets the tone for the\r\nentire story in the first line and in perfectly introduces the film’s protagonist. The tone is friendly,\r\nlight, and informative. Starting the film from Ray Liotta’s perspective ensures that the audience is on\r\nhis side from the start, even though he’s going to do many terrible things throughout the story.\r\nGood voiceover speaks directly to the audience and can help them side with the bad guys, and\r\nsometimes even root for them!</p>"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly2.jpg","alt":"Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>4) Memento</h2>\r\n<p>As with almost every Christopher Nolan film, much of Memento’s success relies on mystery and the\r\ngradual revelation of new information, so we’ll keep this section free of spoilers. Memento follows\r\nLeonard (played by Guy Pearce), a man who cannot maintain new memories for long, due to a head\r\ninjury. Leonard is trying to find his wife’s killer. Leonard forgets everything that has happened the\r\nprevious day when he sleeps and voiceover narration is used to great effect as it helps the audience\r\nget an idea of what’s going on in his head. Voice-over narration is absolutely crucial to the story, as\r\nso much of the drama is concerned with Leonard’s internal struggle to remember what’s happening\r\n,  who’s good and who’s bad, etc. Voiceover gives us a direct line to Leonard’s mind, showing us\r\nwhat he doesn’t understand or can’t remember. A lot of the drama comes from the fact that we\r\nknow something Leonard has forgotten, without voiceover, this would be impossible.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>3) American Psycho</h2>\r\n<p>American Psycho is a disturbing story of a mentally unhinged psychopath called Patrick Bateman\r\nwho goes on a murder spree in the New York yuppie scene in the 80s. Much of the film’s best\r\nmoments involve voiceover, as Patrick (played by Christian Bale) talks us through his skincare routine\r\nor frets about his co-workers’ superior business cards. The voiceover work is often funny, despite the\r\nfilm’s dark themes. And, just as with Goodfellas, the voiceover pulls us closer to the narrator and\r\nmakes us almost root for him, despite his evil deeds. As the film is more about Patrick’s unhinged\r\nthoughts, the voiceover allows the audience to hear his thoughts and understand his motivations.\r\nIt’s impossible to imagine American Psycho without Bale’s excellent voiceover performance!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly3.jpg","alt":"Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly4.jpg","alt":"Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$4"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly5.jpg","alt":"Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I hope you enjoyed our top 5 list of films that use voiceover narration perfectly! Guy Harris is an\r\nexperienced voiceover artist with a wide repertoire of voices to offer different productions and\r\ncommercial brands. If you’d like to work out whether Guy’s voice is right for your brand, listen to his\r\n <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">character voiceover show reels </a> and get in touch. Ask Guy to sample your script for free!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L6",null,{"pageTitle":"Voice-over Narration in Movies","pageUrl":"top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L5","941",{"href":"/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film.